{"ID":"20240205153647-7zr1a12","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153647-7zr1a12","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153647-7zr1a12\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140511-19ny92l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164004-ayxbiyo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140511-19ny92l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:94,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:94\u0026#125;","title":"天竺黄（竹膏、竹黄、天竹黄）","type":"doc","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206140511-19ny92l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140511-19ny92l","updated":"20240206140520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广东、广西、云南等地。\n【性状】\t本品为不规则的片块或颗粒，大小不一。表面灰蓝色、灰黄色或灰白色，有的洁白色，半透明，略带光泽。体轻，质硬而脆，易破碎，吸湿性强。无臭，味淡。\n【性味】\t甘，寒。\n【功效】\t清热豁痰，凉心定惊。用于热病神昏，中风痰迷，小儿痰热惊痫、抽搐、夜啼。"}]},{"ID":"20240206140510-oruhzy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140510-oruhzy8","updated":"20240206140510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206140510-sqsgffk.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205164004-ayxbiyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205164004-ayxbiyo","updated":"20240205164004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天竺黄"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天竺黄-20240205164004-5l9pwp1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711174510-wiegtmv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711174510-wiegtmv","updated":"20240711175537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 399px;","style":"width: 389px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天竺黄"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天竺黄-20240711174843-716idmd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 389px;\" parent-style=\"width: 399px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711175539-4ovvz3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711175539-4ovvz3y","updated":"20240712081238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 331px;","style":"width: 321px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹胶20240711_175740"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹胶20240711_175740-20240711175803-9e3xla5.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 321px;\" parent-style=\"width: 331px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 437px;","style":"width: 427px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天竺黄 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天竺黄 1-20240712081326-196m75l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 427px;\" parent-style=\"width: 437px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712081411-j0ppcc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712081411-j0ppcc1","updated":"20240712081411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 460px;","style":"width: 450px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天竺黄 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天竺黄 2-20240712081411-dn2fu78.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 450px;\" parent-style=\"width: 460px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 460px;","style":"width: 450px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天竺黄 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天竺黄 3-20240712081458-7c1hjyj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 450px;\" parent-style=\"width: 460px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712085139-4qpm15i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712085139-4qpm15i","updated":"20240830164356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 241px;","style":"width: 231px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626082145-kg4qq3y.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 231px;\" parent-style=\"width: 241px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 589px;","style":"width: 579px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹叶1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹叶1-20240626082223-coateiz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 579px;\" parent-style=\"width: 589px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 321px;","style":"width: 311px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹子-20240826175929-ea84ulo.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 311px;\" parent-style=\"width: 321px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712085139-x63gq5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712085139-x63gq5g","updated":"20240712085139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 574px;","style":"width: 564px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹子 1-20240712082600-bwyavp5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 564px;\" parent-style=\"width: 574px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 644px;","style":"width: 634px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹子-20240712082514-yfgo7zw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 634px;\" parent-style=\"width: 644px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712085139-iqpnihz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712085139-iqpnihz","updated":"20240712085139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 560px;","style":"width: 550px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹子 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹子 2-20240712082721-jzuac0b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 550px;\" parent-style=\"width: 560px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 499px;","style":"width: 489px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹子 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹子 3-20240712082745-u28polh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 489px;\" parent-style=\"width: 499px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712085139-qy2r3eu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712085139-qy2r3eu","updated":"20240712085139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 429px;","style":"width: 419px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹林"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹林-20240702132749-s8q4bxq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 419px;\" parent-style=\"width: 429px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 639px;","style":"width: 629px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"竹叶2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/竹叶2-20240626082356-8xqrpac.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 629px;\" parent-style=\"width: 639px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711175207-myn1vks","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240711175207-myn1vks"}},{"ID":"20240830164430-xd8c8xp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-xd8c8xp","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：天竹黄"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-5z1x8gg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-5z1x8gg","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天竹黄"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-q1upf61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-q1upf61","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-4akg7jz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-4akg7jz","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品始载于《蜀本草》，原名竹黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-g4fcd3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-g4fcd3c","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.韩保升曰：“《图经》云：竹节间黄白者，味甘，名竹黄。”2.《日华子》谓：“此是南海边竹内尘沙结成者耳。”3.《开宝本草》云：“按《临海志》云：生天竺国，今诸竹内往往得之。”4.《纲目》指出：“按吴僧赞宁云：竹黄生南海镛竹中。此竹极大，又名天竹。其内有黄，可以疗疾。”上述本草所云天竹黄的来源与今相同。"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-svrm2gv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-svrm2gv","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】TiānZhúHuánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-qn80urn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-qn80urn","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】竹黄、天竺黄、竹膏、竹糖"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-ue4mfgm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-ue4mfgm","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-13tk9gq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-13tk9gq","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为禾本科植物青皮竹、薄竹等竹节间贮积的伤流液，经干涸凝结而成的块状物质。"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-mqu66sa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-mqu66sa","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.BambusatextilisMcClure2.Leptocannachinensis（Rendle）ChiaetH.L.Fung[SchizostachyumchinenseRendle]"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-mzhnq2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-mzhnq2t","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：冬季采收，砍取竹竿，剖取竹黄，晾干。竹黄由于自然产出者较少，大多采取火烧竹林的方法，使竹暴热后，竹沥溢在节间凝固而成，然后剖取晾干。另，用在青皮竹上人工打洞的方法，也能形成竹黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-g92zjk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-g92zjk0","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-xgygif6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-xgygif6","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.青皮竹竿高8-10m，直径3-5cm，尾梢弯垂，下部挺直；节间长40-70cm，绿色，幼时被白蜡粉，并贴生淡棕色刺毛，后变无毛；分枝常自竿中下部第7-11节开始，以数枝或多枝簇生，中央1枝略较粗长。箨鞘早落；箨耳较小，不相等，大耳狭长圆形至披针形；箨舌边缘齿裂；箨片直立，易脱落。叶鞘无毛，背部具脊，纵肋隆起；叶耳通常呈镰刀形，边缘具弯曲而呈放射状的繸毛；叶舌边缘啮蚀状；叶片线状被针形至狭披针形，一般长9-17cm，宽1-2cm，先端渐尖具钻状细尖头，基部近圆形或楔形。假小穗单生或簇生于花枝各节，鲜时暗紫色，干时古铜色；小穗含小花5-8朵，顶端小花不孕；颖仅1片，具21脉；外稃椭圆形，具25脉；内稃被针形，具2脊，脊间10脉；鳞被不相等，边线被长纤毛；花丝细长，花药黄色，子房基部具柄，花柱被短硬毛，柱头3羽毛状。"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-28u70h6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-28u70h6","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.薄竹竿高5-8m，直径2-3cm。节间长30-45cm，上半部于幼嫩时被白色柔毛，老时毛落。分枝常于竿基部第3节上开始，近水平开展。竿箨幼时紫红色，老时变枯黄色，其长度常为其节间的一半；箨鞘近呈梯形；箨耳呈极狭的线形；箨舌近全缘；箨片窄三角形，先端长渐尖，边缘在近先端部分内卷。叶鞘无毛，先端带紫红色；叶耳和鞘口繸毛具芒；叶舌近截形。叶片被针形至长圆状披针形，长15-26cm，宽3-4.5cm，次脉7-9对，小横脉明显，先端长渐尖，基部近圆形或宽楔形；叶柄紫红色，无毛，长约5mm。花枝长35-40cm，节间长3-6cm；次级分枝长5-10cm，基部托以鞘状苞片，基部抱茎。假小穗先端渐尖；苞片卵状披针形，长7-11mm。小穗先端渐尖；颖2片，呈卵状披针形；不孕外稃卵状披针形，具15脉，背部中脊隆起；内稃具6脉，顶具1束短毛，鳞被3，脉纹不明显；花药基部具不等长的2裂；子房近棒状，花柱狭长，柱头羽毛状。"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-yhi3uzd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-yhi3uzd","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-zxskn5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-zxskn5x","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：1.青皮竹常栽培于低海拔地的河边、村落附近。2.薄竹常生于海拔1500-2500m的山地常绿阔叶灌木林中。"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-ax28p0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-ax28p0p","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.青皮竹分布于广东、广西，现华东、华中、西南各地广为栽培。2.薄竹产云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-ewua5w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-ewua5w4","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】性状鉴别本品呈不规则多角形的片块状或颗粒状，大小不一，有的仅长1-2mm。表面发白色、乳白色、灰褐色或灰蓝色，半透明，略带光泽。体轻，质硬而脆，易破碎，断面光亮，稍显粉性，触之有滑感。吸水性强，置于水中有气泡产生，不溶于水。气微，味甘，有清凉感，舐之粘舌。以片块大、色灰白、光亮、质细、体轻、吸湿性强者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-z1vsm8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-z1vsm8w","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘；寒"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-o90t75r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-o90t75r","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】心；肝；胆经"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-xw0blnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-xw0blnw","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热化痰；凉心定惊。主小儿惊风；癫痫；中风痰迷；热病神昏；痰热咳喘"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-ibrddk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-ibrddk2","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3-9g；或入丸、散；研末，每次0.6-1g。外用：适量，研末敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-t1a5e2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-t1a5e2i","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】无湿热痰火者慎服，脾虚胃寒便溏者禁服。《本草汇》：“久用亦能寒中。”"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-5j8a4jd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-5j8a4jd","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】《临海志》云：“生天竺国。”故名天竺黄。寇宗奭曰：“此是竹内所生，如黄土着竹成片者。”故名竹黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-dc9pnsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-dc9pnsj","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-nomtm9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-nomtm9k","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.论天竹黄清心凉肝、化痰定惊之功1.1.李中梓：“竹黄之寒，专泻少阴之火。火去而惊邪诸证靡不疗矣。”（《雷公炮制药性解》）1.2.缪希雍：“天竺黄，气微寒而性亦稍缓，故为小儿家要药。入手少阴经，小儿惊风天吊诸风热者，亦犹大人热极生风之候也。此药能除热养心，豁痰利窍，心家热清而惊自平，君主安而五脏咸得滋养，故诸证悉除也。明目，疗金疮者，总取甘寒凉血清热之功耳。”（《本草经疏》）2.论天竹黄与竹沥性能异同2.1.李时珍：“竹黄，气味功用与竹沥同，而无寒滑之害。”（《纲目》）2.2.倪朱谟：“竹沥性速，直通经络而有寒滑之功；竹黄性缓，清空解热而更有定惊安神之妙。故前古治小儿惊风天吊，夜啼不眠，客忤痢疟及伤风痰闭，发热气促，人抱龙丸，治婴科惊痰要剂。如大人中风，失音不语，入风痰药中，如屡见奏效。此钱月坡独得之见也。”（《本草汇言》）2.3.苏廷琬：“天竺黄，本草云清心豁痰，功同竹沥，气味稍缓，说亦近似。第痰生于脾，竹之有黄，似入脾而豁痰为切，与竹沥之走经络而利痰热微有不同，不止气味稍缓也。”（《药义明辨》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-rlgqi9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-rlgqi9q","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【集解】：《重庆堂随笔》：“《纲目》止载释名而无集解，出产采取，一切形状皆未之及。按《笔谈补》云：岭南深山中有大竹，竹中有水甚清澈，溪涧之水皆有毒，惟此水无毒，土人陆行多饮之。至深冬则凝结如玉，乃天竹黄也。玉彦祖知雷州日，盛夏之官，山溪涧水皆不可饮，惟剖竹取水，烹任饮啜皆用竹水。次年初召赴阙，各行求竹水不可复得。问土人乃知至冬则凝结，不复成水，遇夜野火烧林木为煨烬，惟竹黄不灰，如火烧兽骨而轻，土人多于火后采拾以供药品，不若生得者为善。此说可补濒湖之未备。”"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-9zn9gp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-9zn9gp9","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-2siv39m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-2siv39m","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.1.用于痰热惊痫等证。天竹黄性寒，既清心、肝之热，又能豁痰利窍，为清热化痰、凉心定惊之良药。味甘力缓，儿科用之尤宜。治小儿痰热急惊抽搐，常配胆南星、朱砂、青黛等药，以清热化痰，熄风定惊，方如《小儿药证直快》抱龙丸、利惊丸等。治痰热癫痫，常配郁金、白矾、僵蚕等药，共奏清热化痰、定痫止痉之功。治中风痰热上壅，喉中声如曳锯者，可配石菖蒲、胆南星、牛黄等药，共奏清心豁痰、开窍醒神之效。取其清心凉肝之功，又可治热病神昏谵语，常配犀角（水牛角代）、生地黄、金银花等药，以清心凉血解毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-0ir1h4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-0ir1h4a","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.2.用于痰热咳喘。用天竺黄以清热化痰，常配全瓜蒌、贝母、桑白皮等药，以加强清肺热化痰之效。"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-dv2c818","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-dv2c818","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1.《日华子》：“伏粉霜。”（引自《纲目》）2.2.蒋仪《药镜》：“同犀角、丹砂，以养心除热，热情而惊悸顿平；同胆星、贝母，以利窍豁痰，痰消而癫痫立止。”2.3.《施今墨对药》：“天竺黄、半夏曲，二药伍用，清热除湿化痰止咳，最宜小儿痰热交炽，消化不良，或风痰将作，目睛呆滞。”"}]},{"ID":"20240830164430-at4emka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164430-at4emka","updated":"20240830164444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830164432-6bk96dr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830164432-6bk96dr","updated":"20240830164444"}},{"ID":"20240830164433-gzjzbuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830164433-gzjzbuj","updated":"20240830164444"}}]}